<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>DNA ve Genetik Kod</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bricolage+Grotesque:opsz,wght@12..96,500;12..96,700;12..96,800&family=Nunito:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;0,700;0,800;1,400&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@500;600&display=swap">
<style>
/* Düzen: laboratuvar defteri — üstte canlı DNA sarmalı, yapışkan sekme çubuğu, tek sütun okuma alanı + yan yana etkileşim kartları */
:root{
  --bg:#EEF3F3; --surface:#FFFFFF; --surface2:#E3EBEC; --ink:#14232A; --muted:#566A72; --line:#CBD8DB;
  --accent:#0E6E73; --accent-soft:#D3EBEA; --ok:#1E8A4C; --ok-soft:#DCF2E4; --bad:#C2413A; --bad-soft:#F8E0DE; --warn:#B7791F; --warn-soft:#FBEFD9;
  --A:#7A4CD3; --T:#D9488F; --G:#2C78D2; --C:#E2812A; --bb:#8AA0A8;
  --f-display:"Bricolage Grotesque", "Trebuchet MS", system-ui, sans-serif;
  --f-body:"Nunito", "Segoe UI", system-ui, sans-serif;
  --f-mono:"IBM Plex Mono", ui-monospace, Consolas, monospace;
  --r:14px;
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){:root:not([data-theme="light"]){
  --bg:#0D1518; --surface:#152227; --surface2:#1C2D33; --ink:#E4EEF0; --muted:#97AEB5; --line:#2A3F46;
  --accent:#4FC3C0; --accent-soft:#163A3C; --ok:#5BD08C; --ok-soft:#163626; --bad:#F07A72; --bad-soft:#3D1D1B; --warn:#F2B35A; --warn-soft:#3A2C14;
  --A:#A889F0; --T:#F07AB5; --G:#6AA9F2; --C:#F5A35A; --bb:#5F7880; color-scheme:dark }}
:root[data-theme="dark"]{
  --bg:#0D1518; --surface:#152227; --surface2:#1C2D33; --ink:#E4EEF0; --muted:#97AEB5; --line:#2A3F46;
  --accent:#4FC3C0; --accent-soft:#163A3C; --ok:#5BD08C; --ok-soft:#163626; --bad:#F07A72; --bad-soft:#3D1D1B; --warn:#F2B35A; --warn-soft:#3A2C14;
  --A:#A889F0; --T:#F07AB5; --G:#6AA9F2; --C:#F5A35A; --bb:#5F7880; color-scheme:dark }

*{box-sizing:border-box}
[hidden]{display:none!important}
body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--f-body);font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;margin:0}
h1,h2,h3,h4{font-family:var(--f-display);line-height:1.15;text-wrap:balance;margin:0}
h2{font-size:clamp(1.6rem,4vw,2.2rem);font-weight:800}
h3{font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:700}
p{margin:0}
.wrap{max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;padding-inline:18px}
.mono{font-family:var(--f-mono)}
.muted{color:var(--muted)}
button{font:inherit;color:inherit;cursor:pointer}
button:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:2px}

/* Baz renkleri */
.bA{--b:var(--A)}.bT{--b:var(--T)}.bG{--b:var(--G)}.bC{--b:var(--C)}
.base{display:inline-grid;place-items:center;min-width:1.7em;height:1.7em;padding-inline:.25em;border-radius:7px;background:var(--b);color:#fff;font-family:var(--f-mono);font-weight:600;font-size:.9em;line-height:1}

/* Kahraman alanı */
header.hero{padding-block:28px 10px}
.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 1fr;gap:24px;align-items:center}
.eyebrow{font-family:var(--f-mono);font-size:.78rem;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent);font-weight:600}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(2.3rem,7vw,3.8rem);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin-block:6px 10px}
.hero h1 span{color:var(--accent)}
.hero-lead{color:var(--muted);max-width:46ch}
.helix-box{position:relative;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r);min-width:0}
.helix-box canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:190px}
.helix-tools{position:absolute;right:8px;bottom:8px;display:flex;gap:6px}
.chip-btn{border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface2);border-radius:999px;padding:4px 12px;font-size:.82rem;font-weight:700}
.chip-btn:hover{border-color:var(--accent)}
.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px 16px;margin-top:12px;font-size:.88rem;color:var(--muted)}
.legend span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}
.progress{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:16px;font-size:.88rem;color:var(--muted)}
.dots{display:flex;gap:5px}
.dots i{width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--surface2);border:1px solid var(--line);display:block}
.dots i.on{background:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent)}
.theme-btn{margin-left:auto}

/* Sekmeler */
nav.tabs{position:sticky;top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);z-index:20;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--bg) 92%,transparent);backdrop-filter:blur(6px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.tabbar{display:flex;gap:6px;overflow-x:auto;padding-block:10px;scrollbar-width:thin}
.tab{flex:0 0 auto;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);border-radius:999px;padding:7px 14px;font-weight:700;font-size:.9rem;white-space:nowrap}
.tab[aria-selected="true"]{background:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--surface)}
.tab .n{font-family:var(--f-mono);font-size:.75rem;opacity:.7;margin-right:4px}

main{padding-block:26px 60px}
section.panel{display:grid;gap:22px}
.panel-head{display:grid;gap:8px}
.panel-head p{color:var(--muted);max-width:68ch}
.prose{display:grid;gap:12px;max-width:70ch}
.prose b{color:var(--accent)}

.card{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r);padding:20px;display:grid;gap:14px;min-width:0}
.card h3 .tag{font-family:var(--f-mono);font-size:.72rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent);display:block;margin-bottom:4px}
.grid2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:16px}
.grid3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px}

.note{border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;display:grid;gap:4px;font-size:.96rem}
.note strong{font-family:var(--f-display)}
.note.tip{background:var(--accent-soft)}
.note.warn{background:var(--warn-soft)}
.note.bad{background:var(--bad-soft)}
.note.ok{background:var(--ok-soft)}

.def{border-left:4px solid var(--accent);padding:6px 0 6px 14px}
.def dt{font-family:var(--f-display);font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem}

details.ans{border:1px dashed var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--surface2)}
details.ans summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)}
details.ans[open] summary{margin-bottom:6px}

.btn{border:none;background:var(--accent);color:var(--surface);padding:9px 16px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:800}
.btn.ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--accent);border:1.5px solid var(--accent)}
.btn:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:not-allowed}
.row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;align-items:center}

.opt{border:1.5px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);border-radius:10px;padding:9px 14px;text-align:left;font-weight:600}
.opt:hover{border-color:var(--accent)}
.opt.right{background:var(--ok-soft);border-color:var(--ok)}
.opt.wrong{background:var(--bad-soft);border-color:var(--bad)}
.fb{font-size:.95rem;min-height:1.4em}
.fb.ok{color:var(--ok)}.fb.no{color:var(--bad)}

.next-row{display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;margin-top:6px}

/* Yakınlaştırma */
.zoom{display:grid;grid-template-columns:220px minmax(0,1fr);gap:18px;align-items:start}
.zsteps{display:grid;gap:6px}
.zstep{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);border-radius:10px;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;font-weight:700}
.zstep .lv{font-family:var(--f-mono);font-size:.75rem;color:var(--muted);width:1.6em}
.zstep[aria-pressed="true"]{border-color:var(--accent);background:var(--accent-soft)}
.zview{background:var(--surface2);border-radius:12px;padding:12px;display:grid;gap:10px}
.zview svg{width:100%;height:auto;max-height:240px}
.zview .zcap{font-size:.96rem}
.fade{animation:fadeIn .45s ease}
@keyframes fadeIn{from{opacity:.2;transform:scale(.96)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}

/* Sıralama */
.pool,.slots{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}
.slots .slot{min-width:110px;height:42px;border:2px dashed var(--line);border-radius:10px;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:800;font-family:var(--f-display)}
.slots .arrow{align-self:center;color:var(--muted)}
.pill{border:1.5px solid var(--accent);background:var(--surface);color:var(--accent);border-radius:999px;padding:7px 14px;font-weight:800}
.pill:disabled{opacity:.3}

/* Kalıtsal mı sınıflama */
.sort-list{display:grid;gap:8px}
.sort-item{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;background:var(--surface)}
.sort-item .row{gap:6px}
.sort-item .opt{padding:5px 10px;font-size:.88rem}
.sort-item.done-ok{border-color:var(--ok);background:var(--ok-soft)}
.sort-item.done-no{border-color:var(--bad);background:var(--bad-soft)}
.sort-item small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:.85rem}

/* Nükleotid kurucu */
.nuc-wrap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:18px;align-items:center}
.nuc-svg{width:100%;max-width:340px;height:auto}
.base-pick{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.base-pick button{border:none;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;color:#fff;font-weight:800;background:var(--b)}
.base-pick button[aria-pressed="true"]{outline:3px solid var(--ink);outline-offset:2px}
.big-name{font-family:var(--f-display);font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:800}

/* Eşleştirme oyunu */
.strand-game{display:grid;gap:8px;overflow-x:auto;padding-bottom:4px}
.sg-row{display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:center}
.sg-row .lbl{width:74px;flex:0 0 auto;font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted);font-family:var(--f-mono)}
.cell{width:40px;height:40px;flex:0 0 auto;border-radius:9px;display:grid;place-items:center;font-family:var(--f-mono);font-weight:600;color:#fff;background:var(--b,var(--surface2))}
.cell.empty{background:var(--surface);border:2px dashed var(--line);color:var(--muted)}
button.cell{border:none}
.cell.okc{box-shadow:0 0 0 3px var(--ok)}
.cell.noc{box-shadow:0 0 0 3px var(--bad)}
.bonds{display:flex;gap:6px;padding-left:80px}
.bonds span{width:40px;flex:0 0 auto;text-align:center;font-family:var(--f-mono);font-size:.75rem;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:-.1em}

/* Hasar */
.dmg-view{display:flex;gap:4px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
.dmg-col{display:grid;gap:4px}
.dmg-col .cell{width:34px;height:34px;font-size:.85rem}
.cell.hurt{background:var(--surface2)!important;color:var(--bad);border:2px solid var(--bad)}

/* Hesap laboratuvarı */
.calc-q{font-size:1.05rem}
.calc-in{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center}
.calc-in input{width:120px;padding:9px 12px;border-radius:10px;border:1.5px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink);font:inherit;font-family:var(--f-mono)}
.formula{font-family:var(--f-mono);background:var(--surface2);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;display:grid;gap:4px;font-size:.92rem;overflow-x:auto}
.mat-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px}
.mat{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:8px 10px;background:var(--surface2)}
.mat label{flex:1;font-weight:700;font-size:.92rem;min-width:0}
.mat input{width:64px;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:8px;border:1.5px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink);font:inherit;font-family:var(--f-mono)}
.mat .sw{width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:4px;background:var(--b);flex:0 0 auto}
.score-chip{font-family:var(--f-mono);font-size:.85rem;background:var(--surface2);border-radius:999px;padding:4px 12px}

/* Kromozom grafiği */
.bars{display:grid;gap:7px}
.bar{display:grid;grid-template-columns:130px minmax(0,1fr) 46px;gap:10px;align-items:center;font-size:.92rem}
.bar .track{height:16px;background:var(--surface2);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden}
.bar .fill{height:100%;background:var(--accent);border-radius:6px;transition:width .8s ease}
.bar.human .fill{background:var(--A)}
.bar .v{font-family:var(--f-mono);text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.chroma-svg{width:100%;max-width:420px;height:auto;display:block;margin-inline:auto}
.chroma-svg .st{transition:opacity .6s ease}

/* Eşlenme simülatörü */
.rep-stage{position:relative;height:340px;background:var(--surface2);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden}
.rtile{position:absolute;width:40px;height:32px;margin-left:-20px;border-radius:8px;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#fff;font-family:var(--f-mono);font-weight:600;background:var(--b);transition:left .7s ease,opacity .6s ease,transform .7s ease}
.rtile.new{background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,var(--b) 0 6px,color-mix(in srgb,var(--b) 70%,#fff) 6px 12px)}
.rbond{position:absolute;height:2px;border-top:2px dotted var(--muted);transition:opacity .4s ease}
.rbox{position:absolute;top:6px;bottom:6px;border:2px solid var(--accent);border-radius:12px;transition:opacity .5s ease;pointer-events:none}
.rbox b{position:absolute;bottom:-2px;left:50%;transform:translate(-50%,0);background:var(--accent);color:var(--surface);font-size:.72rem;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:6px 6px 0 0;white-space:nowrap;font-family:var(--f-mono)}
.rlabel{position:absolute;top:6px;font-size:.7rem;font-family:var(--f-mono);color:var(--muted);transform:translateX(-50%);transition:left .7s ease,opacity .5s;white-space:nowrap}
.steps-txt{display:grid;gap:6px;counter-reset:s;padding:0;margin:0;list-style:none}
.steps-txt li{padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);opacity:.55;transition:opacity .3s}
.steps-txt li.cur{opacity:1;border-color:var(--accent);background:var(--accent-soft)}
.steps-txt li::before{counter-increment:s;content:counter(s) ". ";font-family:var(--f-mono);font-weight:600;color:var(--accent)}

/* Doğru/Yanlış kartları */
.myth{display:grid;gap:8px;padding:14px 16px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;background:var(--surface)}
.myth .claim{font-weight:700}
.myth .res{font-size:.95rem}

/* Sözlük */
.gloss-search{padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;border:1.5px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink);font:inherit;width:100%;max-width:360px}
.gloss{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:8px 18px}
.gloss div{padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.gloss b{font-family:var(--f-display)}

/* Test */
.q{display:grid;gap:10px;padding:16px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;background:var(--surface)}
.q .qt{font-weight:600}
.q .qt .cmp{font-weight:400}
.q .qn{font-family:var(--f-mono);font-size:.78rem;color:var(--accent);font-weight:600}
.q .opts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:8px}
.q .exp{font-size:.93rem;color:var(--muted)}
.result-box{position:sticky;bottom:12px;z-index:5;justify-self:center;background:var(--ink);color:var(--bg);border-radius:999px;padding:8px 20px;font-weight:800;font-family:var(--f-display)}

table.cmp{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:.95rem}
table.cmp th,table.cmp td{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top}
table.cmp th{font-family:var(--f-display);background:var(--surface2)}
.tbl{overflow-x:auto}

@media (max-width:760px){
  .hero-grid,.grid2,.nuc-wrap,.zoom{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}
  .grid3{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}
  .mat-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}
  .q .opts,.gloss{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}
  .bar{grid-template-columns:100px minmax(0,1fr) 40px}
  .zsteps{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr))}
  .zstep{padding:6px 8px;font-size:.85rem}
  body{font-size:16px}
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header class="hero wrap">
  <div class="hero-grid">
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow">8. Sınıf Fen Bilimleri · 2. Ünite · 1. Bölüm</div>
      <h1>DNA ve <span>Genetik Kod</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-lead">Göz rengin, kan grubun, saç tipin… Hepsinin tarifi hücrelerinin çekirdeğindeki dört harflik bir alfabede yazılı. Bu notta o alfabeyi okumayı, kopyalamayı ve saymayı öğreneceksin.</p>
      <div class="legend" aria-label="Baz renkleri">
        <span><b class="base bA">A</b> Adenin</span>
        <span><b class="base bT">T</b> Timin</span>
        <span><b class="base bG">G</b> Guanin</span>
        <span><b class="base bC">C</b> Sitozin</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="helix-box">
      <canvas id="heroHelix" aria-label="Dönen DNA ikili sarmalı animasyonu" role="img"></canvas>
      <div class="helix-tools"><button class="chip-btn" id="heroPause" type="button">Durdur</button></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="progress">
    <span>İlerleme:</span><div class="dots" id="dots"></div><span id="progTxt" class="mono">0/10</span>
    <button class="chip-btn theme-btn" id="themeBtn" type="button">Tema: Sistem</button>
  </div>
</header>

<nav class="tabs" aria-label="Bölümler">
  <div class="wrap tabbar" role="tablist" id="tabbar"></div>
</nav>

<main class="wrap">

<!-- 1 MERAK -->
<section class="panel" id="p-merak" data-title="🔎 Merak Et">
  <div class="panel-head">
    <div class="eyebrow">Başlarken</div>
    <h2>Neden herkes birbirinden farklı?</h2>
    <p>İnsanların ten rengi, göz rengi, boyu ve saç tipi birbirinden farklı olabilir. Önce kendi tahminini yap, sonra okumaya geç.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h3><span class="tag">Tahmin et</span>Sence bu farklılıkların asıl sebebi ne?</h3>
    <div class="row" id="guessOpts"></div>
    <p class="fb" id="guessFb"></p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid2">
    <div class="card">
      <h3><span class="tag">Tanım</span>Kalıtım</h3>
      <p>Özelliklerin bir kuşaktan bir sonraki kuşağa geçmesine <b>kalıtım</b> denir. Bu yüzden sen halandan ya da amcandan çok annene ve babana benzersin.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3><span class="tag">Tanım</span>Kalıtsal karakter</h3>
      <p>Canlıların atalarından aldıkları ve çoğunlukla değişmeden sonraki nesillere aktardıkları özelliklere <b>kalıtsal karakter</b> denir. Göz rengi, kan grubu ve saç tipi bunlara örnektir.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h3><span class="tag">Etkinlik</span>Kalıtsal mı, çevreden mi?</h3>
    <p class="muted">Her özellik için seçimini yap. Doğru cevabı ve kısa açıklamayı hemen göreceksin.</p>
    <div class="sort-list" id="heredSort"></div>
    <p class="mono muted" id="heredScore"></p>
  </div>

  <div class="note tip">
    <strong>Tek yumurta ikizleri</strong>
    <p>Tek yumurta ikizlerinin göz rengi, cinsiyeti ve kan grubu aynıdır, çünkü DNA dizilimleri aynıdır. Diğer canlıların birbirinden farklı olmasının sebebi ise kalıtım maddelerinin (DNA) farklı olmasıdır.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h3><span class="tag">Bu bölümde</span>Neler öğreneceksin?</h3>
    <div class="grid2" style="gap:6px 18px">
      <p>☐ Nükleotid, gen, DNA ve kromozom arasındaki ilişki</p>
      <p>☐ Nükleotidin yapısı ve dört organik baz</p>
      <p>☐ DNA'nın ikili sarmal yapısı ve eşleşme kuralı</p>
      <p>☐ DNA'daki sayısal ilişkiler ve malzeme hesapları</p>
